@startuml
[*] --> Created : new ChatUser(name, mediator)
Created --> Joined : chatRoom.register(user)
Joined --> Joined : send(message)
Joined --> Joined : receive(from, message)
Joined --> [*] : demo ends
note bottom of Joined
  While joined, every send() is routed by
  ChatRoom.notify() to all other registered
  users; the user never contacts peers directly.
end note
@enduml
